---
layout: template.njk
slug: estimate-painters
title: Estimate form for painters (free PDF) | Jobchit
description: A free, printable estimate form for painters. Rooms and surfaces, coats, paint and sheen, prep, line items and total, with a line for the customer to sign. No account needed.
heading: Estimate for painters
sub: Rooms, coats, paint and prep on one page, with line items, a total and a line for the customer to sign when they say yes.
tips:
  - Give each room or surface its own line, so the customer can see what each part costs.
  - Write the coats, product and sheen, so the customer can compare your price with another painter's.
  - Say who supplies the paint and whether it is in the price.
  - Put a date the price is good until. When the customer agrees, have them sign and date it, and keep a copy each.
---
<header class="sheet__head">
  <h2 class="sheet__title">Estimate</h2>
  <div class="sheet__no"><span class="f__label">Estimate no.</span><span class="f__line f__line--short"></span></div>
</header>
<div class="sheet__sec">
  <div class="fields fields--3">
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">Business name</span><span class="f__line"></span></div>
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">License no.</span><span class="f__line"></span></div>
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">Phone and email</span><span class="f__line"></span></div>
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">Customer</span><span class="f__line"></span></div>
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">Job address</span><span class="f__line"></span></div>
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">Date</span><span class="f__line"></span></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="sheet__sec">
  <h3 class="sheet__h">Paint and surfaces</h3>
  <div class="fields fields--3">
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">Rooms or surfaces</span><span class="f__line"></span></div>
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">Number of coats</span><span class="f__line"></span></div>
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">Paint supplied by</span><span class="f__line"></span></div>
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">Paint brand and product</span><span class="f__line"></span></div>
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">Colors and sheens</span><span class="f__line"></span></div>
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">Prep and repairs included</span><span class="f__line"></span></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="sheet__sec">
  <table class="items">
    <caption class="jc-sr">Line items</caption>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Description</th><th scope="col" class="items__n">Qty</th><th scope="col" class="items__n">Unit price</th><th scope="col" class="items__n">Amount</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
      <tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
      <tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
      <tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
      <tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
      <tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
      <tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
      <tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <div class="sums">
    <div class="sums__row"><span class="f__label">Subtotal</span><span class="f__line f__line--money"></span></div>
    <div class="sums__row"><span class="f__label">Tax (____%)</span><span class="f__line f__line--money"></span></div>
    <div class="sums__row sums__row--total"><span class="f__label">Total</span><span class="f__line f__line--money"></span></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="sheet__sec">
  <div class="fields fields--3">
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">Price good until</span><span class="f__line"></span></div>
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">Deposit, if any</span><span class="f__line f__line--money"></span></div>
    <div class="f"><span class="f__label">Paint in the price (yes or no)</span><span class="f__line"></span></div>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="sheet__notice">Customer approval: I accept this estimate.</p>
<div class="sigs">
  <div class="sig"><span class="f__line f__line--sig"></span><span class="f__label">Customer signature</span></div>
  <div class="sig sig--date"><span class="f__line f__line--sig"></span><span class="f__label">Date</span></div>
</div>
<p class="sheet__foot">Free template from jobchit.com. General information, not legal advice.</p>
